==Battleground==
*4 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Maawth]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**8 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite backliners being spammed, basic fodder units can beat this stage due to there being next to no pushing power. If one wishes to speed things up, a unit capable of dealing with Mooth or Maawth such as Cataur can help.

